<title>USA: Diana Corp stake sold by Sattel.</title>
<headline>Diana Corp stake sold by Sattel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sattel Technologies Inc said Tuesday it sold its stake in Diana Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Sattel said its latest transactions include the sale of 315,000 common shares between February 11 and February 14 at prices ranging from $10.50 to $11.875 per share.</p>
</text>
